  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empowering Dads through School-Based Chapters</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This fall, Fathering Together is launching school-based dad groups in local elementary schools to support deeper engagement between dads and their kids. These groups will work with school administration and parenting organizations like PTA/PTO. Our goal is to shift dads from &quot;dropping off&quot; their kids to &quot;stepping in&quot; to their children&apos;s development, education, and growth.</narrative>
  </description>
